title: "Emergence Lab: Structured Adaptive Node Systems"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Cebula"
    given-names: "Robert J. S."
    alias: "Bobby"
version: "2026.09.03"
date-released: 2026-09-03
repository-code: "https://github.com/leonardodecreative/EmergenceLab"
url: "https://github.com/leonardodecreative/EmergenceLab"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Emergence Lab is an experimental research program for structured,
  history-dependent, locally coupled adaptive node systems. Its current
  conceptual node state separates identity, perception and memory,
  failure-triggered response, integration attempt, and continuous resonance
  into five non-scalar coordinates, while keeping consequential history and
  energetic bookkeeping outside the core tuple.
keywords:
  - adaptive systems
  - complex systems
  - multi-agent systems
  - dynamical systems
  - relational continuity
  - constituent replacement
